          "snippet": {
            "line": 16,
            "text": "theorem profileStress_lower_bound {C : ℝ} (hC : 0 < C) (d : TailData) (y0 : ℝ) :\n    ∃ ε c : ℝ, 0 < ε ∧ 0 < c ∧ ∀ η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1,\n      ∀ x : ℝ, 0 < x → x < ε →\n        c * FlatCutoff.edge 4 x / x ^ 3 ≤ ‖profileStress C d y0 (η, x)‖"
          }
